<title>USA: McDonnell Douglas wins F-15 parts contract.</title>
<headline>McDonnell Douglas wins F-15 parts contract.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Air Force said on Tuesday that it awarded a $120 million contract increase to McDonnell Douglas for support equipment for F-15S fighter aircraft.</p>
<p>It said the work is to be completed in January 2000.</p>
</text>
